# Title: Invoke-Obfuscation STDIN+ Launcher - Security
# ID: 0c718a5e-4284-4fb9-b4d9-b9a50b3a1974
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Jonathan Cheong, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-15
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1027, attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
# Description: Detects Obfuscated use of stdin to execute PowerShell
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((EventID == "4697" AND (ServiceFileName CONTAINS "cmd" AND ServiceFileName CONTAINS "powershell")) AND ((ServiceFileName CONTAINS "${input}" OR ServiceFileName CONTAINS "noexit")) AND ((ServiceFileName CONTAINS " /c " OR ServiceFileName CONTAINS " /r ")))
